@startuml
title Aveli — Access Resolution Sequence

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #6E7781
  LifeLineBorderColor #30363D
  LifeLineBackgroundColor white
  ParticipantBorderColor #30363D
  ParticipantBackgroundColor white
  ParticipantFontColor #0D1117
}

actor User

participant "Aveli Mobile App" as App
participant "Secure Storage" as Secure
participant "Aveli Backend" as API
participant "PostgreSQL" as DB
participant "RevenueCat" as RC

User -> App : Launch application

App -> Secure : Load session tokens
Secure --> App : Tokens / no session

alt No valid session

  App --> User : Show authentication flow

else Session exists

  App -> Secure : Load cached access snapshot
  Secure --> App : Cached AccessState

  App -> App : Evaluate verification policy

  alt Cached access still trusted

    App -> App : Use cached access decision
    App --> User : Open Workspace

  else Verification required

    App -> API : GET /v1/access\nAuthorization: Bearer <token>

    API -> DB : Load account access state
    DB --> API : Grants + subscription + trial

    API -> API : Resolve effective access source

    API --> App : AccessState

    App -> Secure : Persist trusted access snapshot

    alt Access granted
      App --> User : Open Workspace
    else No access
      App --> User : Open Access Gate
    end

  end

end

== Subscription Purchase / Restore ==

User -> App : Purchase / restore subscription
App -> RC : Start purchase / restore
RC --> App : CustomerInfo / result

App -> API : POST /v1/billing/sync
API -> RC : Verify subscription state
RC --> API : Current entitlement state

API -> DB : Update subscription state
API -> API : Resolve access
API --> App : Updated AccessState

App -> Secure : Update access snapshot

alt Access granted
  App --> User : Open Workspace
else Access denied
  App --> User : Keep Access Gate
end

== Offline Scenario ==

User -> App : Launch without network
App -> Secure : Load cached AccessState
Secure --> App : Snapshot

App -> App : Check offline grace

alt Snapshot still valid
  App --> User : Open Workspace
else Verification required
  App --> User : Access Gate / verification required
end

@enduml